{{!
    @template local_awareness/notice/image

    The picture of the image layout: the uploaded image, alone, in the dialogue's media band. The
    title is its alternative text, so a screen reader hears what the notice is; the notice's text,
    when the author wrote one, describes it from the dialogue's body, offscreen. Rendered by
    modal_notice.js into the band, which the image layout shows and every other layout leaves empty.

    Context variables required for this template:
      * url - the image's URL, already through the file API
      * alt - the notice's title as plain text, not HTML

    Example context (json):
    {
        "url": "https://example.com/pluginfile.php/1/local_awareness/bgimage/7/poster.jpg",
        "alt": "Enrolment week"
    }
}}
<img src="{{url}}" alt="{{alt}}" class="la-image">
